Simulation checks active in every fpga run: memory-op AGU == alu_result; one-hot D lookup == find_entry; mt_q ==
  the lookup of MEM's own access in MEM's context whenever MEM uses it; the D port never serves MEM on an edge where
  MEM moves on; it_q's page == the full I-port lookup whenever IF uses it; data-port payload owner == issuing side;
  a_mem_kept (no MEM access abandoned in flight, i.e. no replay under an issued access).
Step 5 bug found and fixed on the way: vec_trap_directed test 3 (indexed load, misaligned element 2) hung at
  ab643d3 (main's VLS sequencer restarts at element 0 on vls_fault even while MEM stalls; with the registered
  translation an indexed element always waits one cycle in ACC); fixed in 7ab4af3.

